# Playback and downloads

`src/playback/` owns the player. Export a `PlayerEngine` (load album, play, pause, next, previous, seekBy ±30, skipTo, subscribe to status). V1 adapter: `expo-audio` `AudioPlaylist` with `loop: "none"`. Do not import `expo-audio` outside this folder. Do not add a second adapter in V1.

Queue is a **single album**; playback **stops at the last track**. Resume **per album id** only:

```ts
{ [albumId]: { trackId: string; positionSec: number; updatedAt: number } }
```

Now Playing calls the engine, not Expo APIs: prev, next, −30s, play/pause, +30s. Second row: sleep timer, add bookmark, bookmarks, read along (`https://sttm.co/{currenScripture.sttmCoSlug}/{currentTrack.startAng}`). Hide read along if the current track has no `startAng` or the current scripture has no `sttmCoSlug`.

Sleep timer: end of this track, remaining tracks through end of album, or hours+minutes (no seconds). Pause via the engine. Note: Track/album timer options use `durationSec` on recorded tracks (`sehaj_paath`, `audiobook`). `radio` has live tracks, which have no duration — hide those options for live tracks.

Downloads: `@kesha-antonov/react-native-background-downloader` (`skipMmkvDependency: true` with MMKV). One Notifee notification per batch. Prefer local file if present, else stream. After reinstall, restore a cloud **wanted-offline** id list and re-download.

Car V1: lock screen / notification / Bluetooth Now Playing from the adapter. Car browse/queue is 
later.
